           ,      !- Beam Solar Day Schedule Name
           ,      !- Diffuse Solar Day Schedule Name
      0.357,      !- ASHRAE Clear Sky Optical Depth for Beam Irradiance (taub)
      2.401;      !- ASHRAE Clear Sky Optical Depth for Diffuse Irradiance (taud)
 
